Parts of this repository are not my own work.

misc.kdl, keybinds.kdl, autostart.kdl, layout.kdl and rules.kdl started as
copies of the niri configuration that CachyOS ships in
https://github.com/CachyOS/cachyos-niri-noctalia under
etc/skel/.config/niri/cfg/, taken at commit 8938e953 (2026-04-22). That
repository is licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3, and
copyright in the original files stays with the CachyOS authors. misc.kdl is
byte for byte identical to the upstream file at that commit. keybinds.kdl is
the upstream file with the launcher moved to Mod+A, Mod+Return repointed at a
personal script, Mod+F changed to fullscreen, and several binds removed.
autostart.kdl keeps the upstream comment header and adds blueman-applet.
rules.kdl keeps the two Steam window rules, the geometry corner radius rule
and the Noctalia wallpaper layer rule. layout.kdl keeps the upstream gap and
preset column width skeleton.

Because those files are derivative works of GPL-3.0 code, this repository is
distributed under the GPL-3.0. The full licence text is in LICENSE.

The setup targets niri (https://github.com/niri-wm/niri, GPL-3.0) and
noctalia-shell (https://github.com/noctalia-dev/noctalia, MIT). Two lines in
misc.kdl also appear in the Niri page of the Noctalia documentation
(https://github.com/noctalia-dev/noctalia-docs), which carries no licence
file; they reach this repository through the GPL-3.0 CachyOS file, and they
are two lines of functional configuration plus one comment.

settings.json is a settings dump written by noctalia-shell and holds my own
values. display.kdl, kittybackup.conf and README.md are mine.
configfastfetch.jsonc follows a boxed fastfetch layout that circulates widely
in the dotfiles community; I could not trace it to a single author, and
everything substantive in it (logo path, custom format, hard coded strings) is
mine.
